                <invention-title lang="de">MEHRBENUTZERAUTHENTIFIZIERUNG AUF EINER VORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">AUTHENTIFICATION MULTI-UTILISATEURS SUR UN DISPOSITIF</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">MULTI-USER AUTHENTICATION ON A DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>In some implementations, authentication tokens corresponding to known users of a device are stored on the device. An utterance from a speaker is received. The utterance is classified as spoken by a particular known user of the known users. A query that includes a representation of the utterance and an indication of the particular known user as the speaker is provided using the authentication token of the particular known user.</p>
            </abstract>
